    "detailed_description": "Handle the unique manual controls in the 3D action runner with spaceship flight simulation to continue your adventure and get more messages from the unknown. Avoid asteroids or fracture them with a plasma laser weapon! Beat Leaderboard! Battle the boss! And enjoy the chaos!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Keyboard Controls</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/83c9780f8527718fbc02510cf8450856.poster.avif?t=1645341069\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/83c9780f8527718fbc02510cf8450856.webp?t=1645341069\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Are designed to simulate the chaos of controlling a spaceship.<br>Each of the 4 colored zones is responsible for movement in a certain direction. Press different buttons in the colored zone to increase movement in a defined (shown by yellow arrows) direction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/085eec77e0cfa41d0528d52e7dfc9eb9.poster.avif?t=1645341069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/085eec77e0cfa41d0528d52e7dfc9eb9.webm?t=1645341069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/085eec77e0cfa41d0528d52e7dfc9eb9.mp4?t=1645341069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The space is enormous - fly as long as you can and meet various gorgeous <i>spacescapes</i> along your way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Leaderboard</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/db8a1050f3dc2fea3eb38b1140770d1d.avif?t=1645341069\" /></div><br>Try your best on your way to the best pilots!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Main Menu</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/da7f6445b396574505ba70c29f87b9ab.poster.avif?t=1645341069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/da7f6445b396574505ba70c29f87b9ab.webm?t=1645341069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/da7f6445b396574505ba70c29f87b9ab.mp4?t=1645341069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Look around and interact directly with screens, gauges, and other equipment of the spaceship cockpit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Campaign</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/95efc5f0e0f51b3cea90c785167d54dd.poster.avif?t=1645341069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/95efc5f0e0f51b3cea90c785167d54dd.webm?t=1645341069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/95efc5f0e0f51b3cea90c785167d54dd.mp4?t=1645341069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This story begins with an unexpected encounter... An unknown messages you. Who is he and what are his motives? That's for you to decide.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plasma Laser Weapon</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/98016c67cf948fb66667f2512b14b98d.poster.avif?t=1645341069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/98016c67cf948fb66667f2512b14b98d.webm?t=1645341069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/98016c67cf948fb66667f2512b14b98d.mp4?t=1645341069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>To destroy the obstacles on your way to...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Boss</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/e7d847967b91dd3277f5a9a51da1f6c1.poster.avif?t=1645341069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/e7d847967b91dd3277f5a9a51da1f6c1.webm?t=1645341069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/e7d847967b91dd3277f5a9a51da1f6c1.mp4?t=1645341069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A real challenge of your skill.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Energetic Music</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/4b9ac812d7105218324457c983d36bf9.poster.avif?t=1645341069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821410/extras/4b9ac812d7105218324457c983d36bf9.webm?t=1645341069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>At each level, you will be accompanied by a new vigorous soundtrack :3<br><br>Originally created in one week for the Brackeys Game Jam 2021.2 with the theme &quot;Let There Be Chaos&quot;. This version includes more content, visual improvements, and optimizations.",
